                    <h2>BeeYarn’s Privacy Policy</h2>
                    <p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> 14th of December, 2025</p>

                    <p>
                        Welcome to BeeYarn’s Privacy Policy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect,
                        use, store, protect, and share your personal information.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        By using BeeYarn, you consent to the collection and processing of your personal
                        data for specific, legitimate, and lawful purposes that we clearly explain to
                        you. We encourage you to read this Privacy Policy together with our Terms of Use
                        so you understand your rights and our obligations regarding your personal data.
                    </p>

                    <h3>Collection of Information</h3>
                    <p>
                        When you download BeeYarn and create an account, certain information will be
                        collected so your profile can be created and your account can be secured. This
                        may include:
                    </p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Name</li>
                        <li>Username</li>
                        <li>Email address</li>
                        <li>Date of birth</li>
                        <li>Gender</li>
                        <li>Photographs</li>
                    </ul>

                    <p>
                        You will also be required to create a password to complete your account
                        registration. After creating your account, you can review and update most of
                        this information in the app settings, except for your location, which may be
                        updated automatically when you grant BeeYarn access to your device’s location
                        services.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        It is your responsibility to ensure that the information in your account remains
                        accurate and up to date. The information collected helps verify that you are a
                        real person, improve the safety of the BeeYarn community, and enhance your app
                        experience.
                    </p>

                    <h3>Use of Your Personal Data</h3>
                    <p>
                        BeeYarn uses your personal data only for lawful and legitimate purposes in line
                        with the NDPR and other applicable data protection laws.
                    </p>

                    <h3>Sharing of Data</h3>
                    <p>
                        BeeYarn does not sell, rent, or trade your personal data. Data is shared only as
                        necessary to operate the service and comply with legal obligations.
                    </p>

                    <h3>Your Rights</h3>
                    <p>
                        You may exercise your data protection rights by contacting
                        <a href="mailto:privacy@beeyarn.com">privacy@beeyarn.com</a>.
                    </p>

                    <h3>Retention of Your Personal Data</h3>
                    <p>
                        Personal data is retained only as long as necessary and anonymized where
                        possible.
                    </p>

                    <h3>Security of Your Personal Data</h3>
                    <p>
                        BeeYarn implements reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect
                        your data, though no system is completely secure.
                    </p>

                    <h3>Children’s Privacy</h3>
                    <p>
                        BeeYarn is intended for users aged 14 years and above. We do not knowingly collect
                        data from children under 14.
                    </p>

                    <h3>Changes to This Privacy Policy</h3>
                    <p>
                        We may update this policy from time to time. Continued use of BeeYarn means you
                        accept the updated policy.
                    </p>

